# schumann_geomag_blitz.te — the F4-conditioned form (abk->f1 | Blitz), Nadel XIV.
# The unconditional matrix (schumann_geomag.te, bin 3600) stays hourly against the
# hourly Schumann target. The matrix form carries cond rest|none only, so the named
# confounder runs as a conditional PAIR. The confounder is the global lightning
# channel (WGLC), which is DAILY; a daily series is never forward-filled onto 3600
# (that would fabricate intra-hour variation), so this pair runs at bin 86400.
# f2/f3 take the same form with target freq2/freq3.
# The confounder channel is declared `pending`: the register row / CDN series waits on
# Mountain's admission (field/ttl) and Mycelium's manifestation (xfer:mycelium-356-5).
pair schumann_geomag_blitz
register sources
driver abk_dbdt_pt1h
target freq1
cond wglc_strokes pending
cadence live
bin 86400
seasonal none
lags 0,1
surrogate 10
